                    {
                        "translation_id": "d3760a8e-2eef-466d-8f85-2c3035e23255",
                        "source_entry_id": "81b5866c-81e7-342a-ad33-a88321561582",
                        "source_sense_id": "08fad979-cdc2-331f-a2c9-48ac097b37fc",
                        "source_sense_description": "Tourismus: Anhalten von fahrenden Autos, um als Passagier mitgenommen zu werden",
                        "target_lang_word": "autostop",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "autostop",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7964f89a-30cd-33fa-818a-779a0cf1de76",
                                        "entry_id": "f7c3965d-ede7-32d2-a1d5-3eb3e19f9b70",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To stop automatically."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "autostop",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4774b3c4-7415-3142-a6de-78b029bbd622",
                                        "entry_id": "29bfff18-93fe-3df6-899f-36d99b17616c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A coupon-based system of hitchhiking that operated in communist Poland from the 1950s until the 1990s."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b76df9c-cdf3-49ec-ad0e-d6783b622ee9",
                                                "sense_id": "4774b3c4-7415-3142-a6de-78b029bbd622",
                                                "text": "Youth organizations have given autostop activity their stamp of approval."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8963b15-2a85-4dc5-90f5-c35a54cb75fc",
                                                "sense_id": "4774b3c4-7415-3142-a6de-78b029bbd622",
                                                "text": "Autostop members have an advantage over other hitchhikers, because drivers of state cars are allowed to pick up only hitchhikers who display the blue rule book, and most of the cars belong to the state."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7fb60ff-f7dc-48ce-8fa1-2c2a1ab71454",
                                                "sense_id": "4774b3c4-7415-3142-a6de-78b029bbd622",
                                                "text": "Proponents of the system pronounced it a success, especially among the student youth. \"The working class earns money and it can travel on buses or trains or airplanes, but students are the most happy, energetic people, and autostop is convenient for them,\" insisted one supporter in 1966."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "autostop",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72e231fe-228c-356a-ad08-7f64f2934f1f",
                                        "entry_id": "c6c1f1b4-4d30-3557-8b6f-3e8f8185853d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An automatic stopping mechanism or system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5b232cd-187d-49af-bdf2-3398f03cd759",
                                                "sense_id": "72e231fe-228c-356a-ad08-7f64f2934f1f",
                                                "text": "The newest Prager shell features single handed immersion biometry, a Luer fitting to facilitate tubing changes, an autostop for exact manufacturer specified probe depth, and six centering guides to ensure perpendicularity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49b91bac-9c76-4b5e-ba0e-559375580d29",
                                                "sense_id": "72e231fe-228c-356a-ad08-7f64f2934f1f",
                                                "text": "Or you can utilize the autostop features of your trading software to help lock in most of the profit (onehalf to twothirds) of the current potential profit for the move."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3909835-3297-49df-9d8d-9c4111399534",
                                                "sense_id": "72e231fe-228c-356a-ad08-7f64f2934f1f",
                                                "text": "This is a really interesting option of Tshark since it allows us to specify an autostop condition, thanks to which we will not have to be present to manually stop a capture."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed895800-26bc-4eb0-92ea-af00d845807b",
                                                "sense_id": "72e231fe-228c-356a-ad08-7f64f2934f1f",
                                                "text": "The autostop beams would detect people ahead and apply the brakes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "38906bae-127c-46c9-937a-f135239f1eb0",
                        "source_entry_id": "81b5866c-81e7-342a-ad33-a88321561582",
                        "source_sense_id": "08fad979-cdc2-331f-a2c9-48ac097b37fc",
                        "source_sense_description": "Tourismus: Anhalten von fahrenden Autos, um als Passagier mitgenommen zu werden",
                        "target_lang_word": "autostop",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "autostop",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9091af66-05d3-39d8-8701-26750074c69b",
                                        "entry_id": "a5a1a310-3e8c-3eee-8a45-d98bb83f881e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Variante orthographique de auto-stop."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4719d9c0-75b9-4e1b-af85-cd5b80c44de8",
                                                "sense_id": "9091af66-05d3-39d8-8701-26750074c69b",
                                                "text": "On ne doit pas faire de l’autostop le long des autoroutes ou voies rapides, où l’arrêt des véhicules est interdit hors des zones d’arrêt ou de repos prévues à cet effet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "01b1949e-757d-4799-8935-169a444b694a",
                        "source_entry_id": "81b5866c-81e7-342a-ad33-a88321561582",
                        "source_sense_id": "08fad979-cdc2-331f-a2c9-48ac097b37fc",
                        "source_sense_description": "Tourismus: Anhalten von fahrenden Autos, um als Passagier mitgenommen zu werden",
                        "target_lang_word": "auto-stop",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "auto-stop",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "22d089c0-871b-364a-bc03-22874e9d560c",
                                        "entry_id": "764b8e68-7767-3a9a-b7fd-915bb546db7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fait d’arrêter une voiture pour se faire transporter gratuitement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eea2bb0f-3563-4100-8de6-6a0cd250d104",
                                                "sense_id": "22d089c0-871b-364a-bc03-22874e9d560c",
                                                "text": "Quand ils ont fait un peu d’auto-stop sur une route étrangère, quand ils ont collectionné quelques flirts, quand ils sont allés à quelques « surboums », les étudiants s'imaginent connaître la vie : ils n'en connaissent jamais qu'une certaine caricature falucharde."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4661a45b-ed1c-4815-96c1-7233b07eac06",
                                                "sense_id": "22d089c0-871b-364a-bc03-22874e9d560c",
                                                "text": "De là est née l’idée de recourir à l’auto-stop, mais cela d'une manière organisée donnant un maximum de satisfaction et de garantie aussi bien à l’automobiliste qu'à l’auto-stoppeur. Ainsi fut créée par l'initiative privée dans le courant du mois de mai 1978, une association sans but lucratif, dénommée \"Taxistop\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
